

### Login as TRADER first


### Buy stock
POST http://localhost:5000/user-api/buy
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId": "69fac420dc744851abd1d655",
    "stockId": "69fac2b9dc744851abd1d641",
    "quantity": 5
}

### Buy more of the same stock (tests avgBuyPrice recalculation)
POST http://localhost:5000/user-api/buy
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId": "69fac420dc744851abd1d655",
    "stockId": "69fac2b9dc744851abd1d641",
    "quantity": 3
}

### Buy a different stock
POST http://localhost:5000/user-api/buy
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId": "69fac420dc744851abd1d655",
    "stockId": "69fac2bddc744851abd1d643",
    "quantity": 2
}

### Sell stock (partial)
POST http://localhost:5000/user-api/sell
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId": "69fac420dc744851abd1d655",
    "stockId": "69fac2bddc744851abd1d643",
    "quantity": 2
}

### Sell stock (all remaining — should remove from portfolio)
POST http://localhost:5000/user-api/sell
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId": "69fac420dc744851abd1d655",
    "stockId": "69fac2bddc744851abd1d643",
    "quantity": 6
}

### --- ERROR CASES ---

### Buy with insufficient balance
POST http://localhost:5000/user-api/buy
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId": "69fac420dc744851abd1d655",
    "stockId": "69fac2bddc744851abd1d643",
    "quantity": 99999
}

### Sell more than owned
POST http://localhost:5000/user-api/sell
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId": "69fac420dc744851abd1d655",
    "stockId": "69fac2bddc744851abd1d643",
    "quantity": 99999
}

### Buy with invalid stock ID
POST http://localhost:5000/user-api/buy
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId": "69fac420dc744851abd1d655",
    "stockId": "000000000000000000000000",
    "quantity": 1
}

### --- PORTFOLIO & HISTORY ---

### Get user portfolio (with P/L)
GET http://localhost:5000/user-api/portfolio/69fac420dc744851abd1d655

### Get user transaction history
GET http://localhost:5000/user-api/transactions/69fac420dc744851abd1d655
